      "start_srt": "00:00:00,000",
      "end_srt": "00:00:03,000",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:00]",
      "text": "So I have a friend."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.0,
      "end": 5.0,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:03,000",
      "end_srt": "00:00:05,000",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:03]",
      "text": "She's an actress. She's in her 60s."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 5.0,
      "end": 7.0,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:05,000",
      "end_srt": "00:00:07,000",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:05]",
      "text": "And a couple of days before Christmas,"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 7.0,
      "end": 9.0,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:07,000",
      "end_srt": "00:00:09,000",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:07]",
      "text": "she was at the post office."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 9.0,
      "end": 12.0,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:09,000",
      "end_srt": "00:00:12,000",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:09]",
      "text": "Out of nowhere, someone moved her out of the way."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 12.0,
      "end": 14.0,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:12,000",
      "end_srt": "00:00:14,000",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:12]",
      "text": "Just physically put their hands on her"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 14.0,
      "end": 17.83,
      "duration": 3.83,
      "start_srt": "00:00:14,000",
      "end_srt": "00:00:17,830",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:14]",
      "text": "and moved her out of the way."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 17.83,
      "end": 20.83,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:17,830",
      "end_srt": "00:00:20,830",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:17]",
      "text": "He apparently needed something that she was blocking."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 20.83,
      "end": 21.83,
      "duration": 1.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:20,830",
      "end_srt": "00:00:21,830",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:20]",
      "text": "So he moved her."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 21.83,
      "end": 24.86,
      "duration": 3.03,
      "start_srt": "00:00:21,830",
      "end_srt": "00:00:24,860",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:21]",
      "text": "She said that she was shocked at first."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 24.86,
      "end": 25.86,
      "duration": 1.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:24,860",
      "end_srt": "00:00:25,860",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:24]",
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 25.86,
      "end": 29.99,
      "duration": 4.13,
      "start_srt": "00:00:25,860",
      "end_srt": "00:00:29,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:25]",
      "text": "And then a fury rose up in her that she could not explain."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 29.99,
      "end": 31.99,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:29,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:31,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:29]",
      "text": "Not annoyance."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 31.99,
      "end": 33.99,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:31,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:33,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:31]",
      "text": "Not frustration."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 33.99,
      "end": 36.99,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:33,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:36,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:33]",
      "text": "But fury was the word that she used."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 36.99,
      "end": 38.99,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:36,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:38,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:36]",
      "text": "And she went on to say,"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 38.99,
      "end": 40.99,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:38,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:40,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:38]",
      "text": "I don't know. I was furious."
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 40.99,
      "end": 42.99,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:40,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:42,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:40]",
      "text": "And I don't know why."
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 42.99,
      "end": 43.99,
      "duration": 1.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:42,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:43,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:42]",
      "text": "I mean, he didn't hit me."
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 43.99,
      "end": 46.99,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:43,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:46,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:43]",
      "text": "He didn't hurt me. He didn't violate me."
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 46.99,
      "end": 48.99,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:46,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:48,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:46]",
      "text": "He moved me."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 48.99,
      "end": 51.99,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:48,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:51,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:48]",
      "text": "There's a culture of men helping themselves to women."
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 51.99,
      "end": 54.99,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:51,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:54,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:51]",
      "text": "And in this case, in a seemingly innocuous way."
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 54.99,
      "end": 58.99,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "start_srt": "00:00:54,990",
      "end_srt": "00:00:58,990",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:54]",
      "text": "But the innocuous makes space for the horrific."
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 58.99,
      "end": 64.5,
      "duration": 5.51,
      "start_srt": "00:00:58,990",
      "end_srt": "00:01:04,500",
      "start_txt": "[00:00:58]",
      "text": "And women have to live with the effects of both"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 64.5,
      "end": 67.92,
      "duration": 3.42,
      "start_srt": "00:01:04,500",
      "end_srt": "00:01:07,920",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:04]",
      "text": "and everything in between."
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 67.92,
      "end": 70.92,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "start_srt": "00:01:07,920",
      "end_srt": "00:01:10,920",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:07]",
      "text": "When someone helps themselves to a woman,"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 70.92,
      "end": 75.92,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "start_srt": "00:01:10,920",
      "end_srt": "00:01:15,920",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:10]",
      "text": "it not only triggers discomfort and distress,"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 75.92,
      "end": 80.95,
      "duration": 5.03,
      "start_srt": "00:01:15,920",
      "end_srt": "00:01:20,950",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:15]",
      "text": "but the unspoken experiences of our mother's lives,"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 80.95,
      "end": 85.95,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "start_srt": "00:01:20,950",
      "end_srt": "00:01:25,950",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:20]",
      "text": "sister's lives, and generations of women before us."
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 85.95,
      "end": 91.1,
      "duration": 5.15,
      "start_srt": "00:01:25,950",
      "end_srt": "00:01:31,100",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:25]",
      "text": "That's lifetimes of women dealing with men"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 91.1,
      "end": 96.36,
      "duration": 5.26,
      "start_srt": "00:01:31,100",
      "end_srt": "00:01:36,360",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:31]",
      "text": "who assume they know better for us than we know for ourselves."
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 96.36,
      "end": 100.36,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "start_srt": "00:01:36,360",
      "end_srt": "00:01:40,360",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:36]",
      "text": "Women have been trained to think that we are overreacting"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 100.36,
      "end": 104.36,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "start_srt": "00:01:40,360",
      "end_srt": "00:01:44,360",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:40]",
      "text": "or that we're being too sensitive or unreasonable."
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 104.36,
      "end": 106.36,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:01:44,360",
      "end_srt": "00:01:46,360",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:44]",
      "text": "We try to make sense of nonsense,"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 106.36,
      "end": 108.36,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:01:46,360",
      "end_srt": "00:01:48,360",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:46]",
      "text": "and we swallow the furious feelings."
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 108.36,
      "end": 111.36,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "start_srt": "00:01:48,360",
      "end_srt": "00:01:51,360",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:48]",
      "text": "We try to put them into some hidden place in our minds,"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 111.36,
      "end": 113.36,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:01:51,360",
      "end_srt": "00:01:53,360",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:51]",
      "text": "but they don't go away."
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 113.36,
      "end": 117.54,
      "duration": 4.18,
      "start_srt": "00:01:53,360",
      "end_srt": "00:01:57,540",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:53]",
      "text": "That fury sits deep inside"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 117.54,
      "end": 120.54,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "start_srt": "00:01:57,540",
      "end_srt": "00:02:00,540",
      "start_txt": "[00:01:57]",
      "text": "as we practice our smiles."
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 120.54,
      "end": 122.54,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:02:00,540",
      "end_srt": "00:02:02,540",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:00]",
      "text": "Yes, of course."
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 122.54,
      "end": 124.54,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:02:02,540",
      "end_srt": "00:02:04,540",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:02]",
      "text": "And try to be pleasant."
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 124.54,
      "end": 127.57,
      "duration": 3.03,
      "start_srt": "00:02:04,540",
      "end_srt": "00:02:07,570",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:04]",
      "text": "Yes, of course."
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 127.57,
      "end": 130.57,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "start_srt": "00:02:07,570",
      "end_srt": "00:02:10,570",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:07]",
      "text": "Because apparently women aren't supposed to get angry."
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 130.57,
      "end": 133.82,
      "duration": 3.25,
      "start_srt": "00:02:10,570",
      "end_srt": "00:02:13,820",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:10]",
      "text": "When someone thinks they can help themselves to our bodies,"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 133.82,
      "end": 137.82,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "start_srt": "00:02:13,820",
      "end_srt": "00:02:17,820",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:13]",
      "text": "it not only ignites the current fury,"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 137.82,
      "end": 139.82,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:02:17,820",
      "end_srt": "00:02:19,820",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:17]",
      "text": "but it lights up the past."
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 139.82,
      "end": 144.3,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "start_srt": "00:02:19,820",
      "end_srt": "00:02:24,300",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:19]",
      "text": "Today, the global collection of women's experiences"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 144.3,
      "end": 146.3,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "start_srt": "00:02:24,300",
      "end_srt": "00:02:26,300",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:24]",
      "text": "can no longer be ignored."
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 146.3,
      "end": 149.82,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "start_srt": "00:02:26,300",
      "end_srt": "00:02:29,820",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:26]",
      "text": "Times up on thinking that we're overreacting,"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 149.82,
      "end": 152.52,
      "duration": 2.7,
      "start_srt": "00:02:29,820",
      "end_srt": "00:02:32,520",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:29]",
      "text": "or this is just the way it is."
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 152.52,
      "end": 159.52,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "start_srt": "00:02:32,520",
      "end_srt": "00:02:39,520",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:32]",
      "text": "Times up on women being held responsible for men's bad behavior."
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 159.52,
      "end": 165.52,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "start_srt": "00:02:39,520",
      "end_srt": "00:02:45,520",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:39]",
      "text": "It is men's responsibility to change men's bad behavior."
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 165.52,
      "end": 172.54,
      "duration": 7.02,
      "start_srt": "00:02:45,520",
      "end_srt": "00:02:52,540",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:45]",
      "text": "And women, I encourage you to acknowledge your fury."
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 172.54,
      "end": 175.44,
      "duration": 2.9,
      "start_srt": "00:02:52,540",
      "end_srt": "00:02:55,440",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:52]",
      "text": "Give it language."
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 175.44,
      "end": 178.86,
      "duration": 3.42,
      "start_srt": "00:02:55,440",
      "end_srt": "00:02:58,860",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:55]",
      "text": "Your fury is not something to be afraid of."
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 178.86,
      "end": 183.18,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "start_srt": "00:02:58,860",
      "end_srt": "00:03:03,180",
      "start_txt": "[00:02:58]",
      "text": "It holds lifetimes of wisdom."
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 183.18,
      "end": 188.26,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "start_srt": "00:03:03,180",
      "end_srt": "00:03:08,260",
      "start_txt": "[00:03:03]",
      "text": "Let it breathe and listen."
    }
  ]
}